1&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=naZnUZyJIFsQ7kNvwFN4P4S&_nc_oc=AdrA1y9_vSOOkJiit-GNk8RtPHr-t5vL16xajvJGUBMC5R-GVI0KHIDZgyqTtaGzhfQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTi4krWm3xJMJY6h8duUQUNjRQBCKP8cjGSHbLUHWfdcQ&oe=6B0C53FA"}, {"file_name": "Newton7N.png", "id": "1750503739493157", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673652249_1750503742826490_2744391703738745826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1LKRtaOwD-AQ7kNvwG6pHGb&_nc_oc=AdpbpggoCWLiNf4b24O2oO9jaEnDpS7AOFuqzuNJNSpPzMqmNCT3Ij9K5ST_325V-iE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRkU2G_mhevx4GDhhv_CxyQJ_mZ4oZ9vf-pj5A6JjUuoQ&oe=6B0C7638"}, {"file_name": "newton2.png", "id": "1362694672514845", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604360590_1362694675848178_7341586796008182829_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_kJakRNscOUQ7kNvwFzhh1u&_nc_oc=AdoQrK5F_zbfGeLPTA8tRSHwzMJSqn7W4r2a5xhWFWz9r0LA18-qIM_zhxG2mcOdgz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ_bSErqfgIIZ-uKt2OSVt6AMeIXXznqX-n9uDERDwoQA&oe=6B0C6514"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "I Am Mad Newton", "keywords": ["Newton", "Physics", "Sandbox", "Simulator", "IAm"], "long_description": "Step into I Am Mad Newton, a wild VR Newton physics playground where every Newton experiment can turn into chaos. In I Am Mad Newton, become a mad scientist and explore a hands-on Newton sandbox filled with physics, gravity, chemistry, ragdolls and interactive machines.\n\nTest Newton physics with force, gravity and momentum. Launch ragdoll dummies from cannons, attach rockets, grab and throw objects, and discover funny Newton reactions. Enter the I Am Mad Newton chemistry lab, mix chemicals, use beakers and lab equipment, trigger reactions and create crazy experiments.\n\nBuild your own Newton setups using cannons, rockets, launchers and physics tools. Push, pull, throw and launch objects, send dummies flying, combine machines and create chain reactions across the Newton physics playground.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 I Am Mad Newton VR physics playground\n\u2022 Newton physics and Newton experiments\n\u2022 Newton gravity, force and momentum\n\u2022 I Am mad scientist chemistry gameplay\n\u2022 Chemistry lab and interactive equipment\n\u2022 Newton physics sandbox freedom\n\u2022 Interactive ragdoll dummies\n\u2022 Cannons, rockets and launchers\n\u2022 Grab, throw, push and launch interactions\n\u2022 Funny Newton ragdoll reactions\n\u2022 Creative physics experiments\n\u2022 Replayable VR simulator action\n\nI Am Mad Newton combines, gameplay, Newton physics, Newton experiments, physics playground action, chemistry, mad scientist fun, ragdoll simulation and sandbox freedom. Enter I Am Mad Newton, test Newton physics and create mad Newton palyground.", "short_description": "Enter I Am Mad Newton, a wild VR physics playground where Newton physics turns every experiment into chaos. In I Am Mad Newton, launch ragdoll dummies from cannons, attach rockets, test gravity, grab and throw objects, and discover crazy physics reactions. I Am Mad Newton combines Newton experiments, physics sandbox gameplay, ragdoll fun and interactive VR action in one mad physics playground.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rebels Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [],